Description: interactive TUI network latency, MTR, traffic and quality monitor
 Pingtop is an interactive terminal-based network monitoring tool written
 in modern C++20 with zero external dependencies.
 .
 Key features:
  * High-frequency ICMP, ICMPv6, TCP SYN/ACK, and UDP/53 DNS latency probing.
  * Hop-by-hop live MTR / Traceroute engine with offline GeoIP/ASN info.
  * Real-time network interface bandwidth monitor with solid UTF-8 block charts.
  * Automatic local gateway, LAN, ARP, and Tailscale/VPN discovery.
  * Latency percentiles (p50, p90, p95, p99), jitter calculation, and MTU check.
  * btop-inspired adaptive responsive terminal UI with zero external runtime deps.
